        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4620, Ornate Augustine Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's 14-1/2 Inch Ornate Door Pull has a 10-3/4 inch center to center. The details of this ornate door handle really pick up the highlights of each of the 7 available finishes. The PH-4620 Ornate Door Handle can be used as a pull on your front door and even as an appliance pull. Its fancy styling is sure to inspire a sense of wealth. Choose from a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/augustine-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-620\"><b>Augustine Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/augustine-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-120\"><b>Augustine Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 10\" Center to Center Ornate Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "14-5/8 Inch Ornate Door Pull",
                "description": "RK International's 14-1/2 Inch Ornate Door Pull has a 10-3/4 inch center to center. The details of this ornate door handle really pick up the highlights of each of the 7 available finishes. The PH-4620 Ornate Door Handle can be used as a pull on your front door and even as an appliance pull. Its fancy styling is sure to inspire a sense of wealth. Choose from a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).\r\n",
